.57</td><td align="left">40.01</td><td align="left">7.91</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">7.69</td><td align="left">3.06</td><td align="left">10.33</td><td align="left">4.15</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Prague</td><td align="left">34.94</td><td align="left">6.51</td><td align="left">38.52</td><td align="left">7.49</td><td align="left">20.27</td><td align="left">4.87</td><td align="left">22.66</td><td align="left">5.62</td><td align="left">5.64</td><td align="left">2.62</td><td align="left">6.19</td><td align="left">2.72</td><td align="left">1.12</td><td align="left">1.09</td><td align="left">1.53</td><td align="left">1.32</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Rome</td><td align="left">52.81</td><td align="left">9.55</td><td align="left">61.71</td><td align="left">10.48</td><td align="left">20.92</td><td align="left">5.52</td><td align="left">26.62</td><td align="left">6.46</td><td align="left">4.87</td><td align="left">2.36</td><td align="left">5.79</td><td align="left">2.6</td><td align="left">2.58</td><td align="left">1.72</td><td align="left">3.73</td><td align="left">2.52</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Stockholm</td><td align="left">27.85</td><td align="left">5.41</td><td align="left">30.81</td><td align="left">6.3</td><td align="left">13.47</td><td align="left">3.84</td><td align="left">14.93</td><td align="left">4.28</td><td align="left">2.96</td><td align="left">1.72</td><td align="left">3.34</td><td align="left">1.81</td><td align="left">2.15</td><td align="left">1.5</td><td align="left">2.76</td><td align="left">1.88</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Turin</td><td align="left">19.14</td><td align="left">4.65</td><td align="left">23.18</td><td align="left">5.35</td><td align="left">7.91</td><td align="left">3.01</td><td align="left">10.3</td><td align="left">3.49</td><td align="left">2.71</td><td align="left">1.67</td><td align="left">3.34</td><td align="left">1.9</td><td align="left">1.02</td><td align="left">1.04</td><td align="left">1.62</td><td align="left">1.44</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Valencia</td><td align="left">14.64</td><td align="left">4.11</td><td align="left">17.92</td><td align="left">5.27</td><td align="left">5.28</td><td align="left">2.41</td><td align="left">6.97</td><td align="left">2.94</td><td align="left">1.57</td><td align="left">1.27</td><td align="left">1.91</td><td align="left">1.46</td><td align="left">1.37</td><td align="left">1.2</td><td align="left">2.09</td><td align="left">1.76</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Zurich</td><td align="left">11.63</td><td align="left">3.52</td><td align="left">13.53</td><td align="left">3.84</td><td align="left">5.24</td><td align="left">2.36</td><td align="left">6.31</td><td align="left">2.59</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">-</td><td align="left">0.6</td><td align="left">0.79</td><td align="left">1.01</td><td align="left">1.09</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>note: * April&#x02013;September, ** October&#x02013;March</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><p>Emergency hospital admission records for the same causes (plus influenza, ICD-9: 487) were selected, following the APHEA-2 project protocol [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B15">15</xref>]. Only main causes of admission were considered. In table <xref ref-type="table" rid="T3">3</xref> mean daily admission counts are summarized by cause and season. Two cities could not provide all requested causes, namely Paris and Zurich. Generally, admission counts were higher in the cold season, especially for respiratory diseases.</p><table-wrap position="float" id="T3"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Hospital admission data: daily mean and standard deviation (sd) by cause and season.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td></td><td align="center" colspan="4"><bold>Cardiovascular </bold><italic>(ICD-IX: 390&#x02013;459)</italic></td><td align="center" colspan="4">